\title{AI Reasoning Verification: Stepwise Verification via NLI}
\taxon{Thesis}
\tag{LLM Reasoning}
\tag{NLP}
\import{macros}
\meta{institution}{\ucam}
\meta{position}{Supervisor: Prof. \andreasvlachos}
\date{2026}

\ul{
  \li{Reframed stepwise reasoning verification as local Natural Language Inference (NLI), employing fair comparison of language models with different architectures and training paradigms.}  
  \li{Results showed that discriminative supervision consistently outperforms generative verdict training across both encoder and decoder LMs. (Supported by the Alan Turing Institute).}
}
